    {
      "id": "sce-start-story-flow-q-342bc6f0",
      "type": "long",
      "stem": "Present a narrative outline for a startup presentation using the template in the deck, saying what each part should cover.",
      "options": [],
      "answer": "",
      "accept": [],
      "explanation": "",
      "model_answer_md": "The deck gives a template for a startup presentation.\n\n**Title and Tag Line.** Name the startup and give it a tag line.\n\n**Our Startup: Interesting Opening.** Open in a way that holds attention.\n\n**Solution.** Present the **Key Features**, the **Advantage** and the **Benefits**.\n\n**Key Achievements.** Show what the startup has achieved.\n\n**Team members.** One slide per member (the template goes to five): their **Department, Contribution, Achievement and Learning**.\n\n**Interesting Conclusion.** Close with something memorable.\n\nIn conclusion, the template tells a story from opening to solution to achievements to people, and ends as strongly as it begins.",
      "rubric": [
        {
          "point": "Title and tag line; interesting opening",
          "source_ref": "sce--startup-presentation#2"
